{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Values the Security Settings Manager refuses in addition to data\\policy\\denylist.json (DECISIONS SM14). key and valueName are case-insensitive regular expressions anchored to the whole name; values lists refused data, or any. source pending means the Learn page was not confirmed at build time; the value is refused anyway. ranks orders the values of a protection from strongest to weakest: a change to a weaker value, or removing a value stronger than the last one, is refused (review P-27, DECISIONS SP5).",
  "entries": [
    {
